## Mission 6: Marketing Autopilot (Verified)
- **Status**: ✅ Verified
- **Feature**: Automated marketing loop controlled via HUD.
- **Implementation**:
    - Backend: `/api/autopilot` triggers background thread in [server.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/nucleus/mcp_server/server.py).
    - Event Stream: Uses [emit_event](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#61-103) to write to `events.jsonl` (visible in HUD) and push to Cloud Bridge.
    - Frontend: Toggle "ENABLE AUTOPILOT" -> "AUTOPILOT ENGAGED".
- **Verification**: 
    - Toggle functionality verified in Browser Test.
    - Event emission logic refactored to ensure local file visibility.

