- **Status**: ✅ Implementation Verified
- **Feature**: Autonomous generation of `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` via Genesis Swarm.
- **Protocol**: `[scripts/genesis_swarm.py]` orchestrates the `Architect` agent with a custom [PlanWriterOps](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/genesis_swarm.py#42-103) capability.
